    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really have time to go to a doctor right now work is crazy and insurance is such a pain... honestly the stretching thing sounds like something people do all the time for back stuff. if it's just a disc issue, wouldn't moving around and stretching it out help loosen up the tension that's pressing on the nerve? like, if i just do some deep yoga stretches or maybe some heavy spinal twists, won't that eventually release the pressure?",
